Attack with your melee weapons for [145%, 160%, 171%, 181%, 190% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] weapon damage as physical and temporal (warp) damage. If either attack hits you may stun, blind, pin, or confuse the target for [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns.

Blade Threading talents will freely swap to your dual-weapons when activated if you have them in your secondary slots.  Additionally you may use the Attack talent in a similar manner.
